    "updated_at": "2021-07-21T10:27:57Z",
    "body": "The order of events here is that you contributed to a fork that ceased to be developed. The HTML Standard of which it was forked never included such information I think.\r\n\r\nI think we would take a PR, though at some point we should figure out what to do about this IANA information as it really needs to be upstreamed to IANA (to the extent it isn't yet) and then a pointer would perhaps suffice.",
